  - GICv3: local SGI/PPI pending state uses redistributor registers
  - AArch64 GIC: interrupt enable state is queryable for benchmark cleanup
  - AArch64 timer: absolute CNTV deadlines with elapsed-tick compensation
  - applications/rt-ipc-test/: RT-IPC UDP server installed
  - applications/task3/: Task 3 UDP/9877 control server installed
